<title>USA: US Treasury new issues calendar - bills/notes/bonds.</title>
<headline>US Treasury new issues calendar - bills/notes/bonds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Issue    Size-$BN  Auction    Settles   Anncmt   Yield-Pct</p>
<p>1-yr     $13.75    Mar 26     Apr 3     Mar 21</p>
<p>2-yr     $17.25    Mar 25     Mar 31    Mar 19</p>
<p>5-yr     $12.5     Mar 26     Mar 31    Mar 19</p>
<p>3-,6-mo  $23.0     Mar 24     Mar 27    Mar 18</p>
<p>10-yr-I		April*</p>
<p>Pricings of Recent Government Auctions</p>
<p>3-,6-mo  $23.0     Mar 17     Mar 20    Mar 11   5.13/5.26</p>
<p>*10-yr-I = 10-year inflation-indexed note. Treasury says it expects to re-open the issue first sold on Jan 29 in April.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
